 "note": "S, 13 platforms, FFA 3, inward. A three-way grinder: a rotor hub (no fixed deck) turns its three bridges between the two triangles of a hexagon of platforms, killing whatever is on them. The hexagon platforms never link each other directly: a pocket between each pair of homes joins two of them, so every road from home to home either crosses the grinder or goes through a pocket two players fight over (both are four bridges). Three-fold symmetric.",
